sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Usuario
    participant C as Cliente (SPA / app)
    participant AS as Servidor de autorización (Keycloak)
    participant RS as Resource server (API)
    U->>C: Pulsa "Entrar"
    Note right of C: genera code_verifier aleatorio<br/>code_challenge = SHA256(verifier)
    C->>AS: Redirige a /authorize?client_id&redirect_uri&scope&code_challenge
    AS->>U: Pantalla de login (y consentimiento)
    U->>AS: Usuario y contraseña (solo los ve Keycloak)
    AS->>C: Redirige a redirect_uri?code=XYZ
    C->>AS: POST /token (code + code_verifier)
    Note over AS: comprueba que SHA256(verifier) == challenge
    AS->>C: access_token (+ refresh_token, id_token)
    C->>RS: GET /api/pedidos con Authorization: Bearer access_token
    Note over RS: valida firma, iss, aud, exp y roles
    RS->>C: 200 OK
